Package: yuz-branding-calamares
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: calamares-settings-debian (>= 13.0.0)
Recommends: calamares (>= 3.3.0), yuz-branding-base
Maintainer: Emad <mysmartlifelevel@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/emad-ms/yuz-branding-calamares
Description: Official Calamares installer branding package for Yuz-OS Edu.
 This package provides the Yuz OS Education installer branding descriptor,
 custom slideshow presentation, Nord-themed visual styling, and integrates
 seamlessly with calamares-settings-debian infrastructure on live media.
